=== what these results mean ===
  asus_glymur_ec_suspend in the trace, returning 0
      -> the EC was told to enter standby, and it acked.
  asus_glymur_ec_resume in the trace, returning 0
      -> the EC was told to exit standby, and it acked.
  a non-zero return, or the function missing
      -> the notification did NOT work; send me the log.
  suspend_stats/success incremented, last_failed_dev empty
      -> the kernel considers the cycle to have completed.

